%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: WerewolfTime
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613200
    - rid: 4351268372525613201
    - rid: 4351268372525613204
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm surprised, you've got quite the swinging arm for someone of your
      size.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613202
    - rid: 4351268372525613203
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I pride myself on packing a punch, just because I'm small doesn't mean
      I'm not strong.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613205
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Hah! Well, you've certainly been a great help with the forge, today.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613206
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: You've got the makings of a fine apprentice if you decide you want a
      break from the action.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe I should work here with Eorlund more; {mc} did say that picking
      up a trade would be a reliable source of income.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Besides, it <i>was</i> a pretty good workout, too.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613208
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, that's all for today. A day's work on the forge deserves a full
      night's rest.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613209
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Good night, Eorlund.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 257fa6872c2d2f24f900979e35fb64cc, type: 2}
    dialog: Good night, Shield-Sister.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613210
    - rid: 4351268372525613220
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Why does no one know my name?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613211
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Speaking of night, just a few more hours...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613212
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I guess I'll hang around Jorrvaskr for a bit...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613213
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Maybe I could pull a Yuri and read one of the books in Kodlak's library.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613214
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not like I have anything better to do...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613215
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613216
    - rid: 4351268372525613218
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: After expanding her literary horizons for the past few hours, it is now
      time for Natsuki's midnight rendevous.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613217
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, stay calm, Kodlak's gonna give me a hand...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Here goes nothing...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613219
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613222
    - rid: 4351268372525613223
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm glad you came. It's been a long time since we had a heart like yours
      among our numbers.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613224
    - rid: 4351268372525613225
    - rid: 4351268372525613226
    - rid: 4351268372525613227
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Who's the werewolf?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613228
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: That pitiful ceremony at the hall does not befit warriors like us.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613229
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (I thought it was pretty nice...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613230
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: You are due more honor than some calls and feasting...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613231
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: I would hope you recognize Aela, even in <i>this</i> form. She's agreed
      to be your forebear.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (How am I supposed to recognize her?!? She looks exactly the same as
      Farkas did!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613232
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: We do this in secret because Kodlak is too busy trying to throw away
      this great gift we've been granted.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613233
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (We'll see how long it remains a secret...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613234
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: He thinks we've been cursed, but we've been blessed. How can something
      that gives this kind of power be a curse?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613235
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: So, we take matters into our own hands...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Skjor walks over to Aela, cutting her arm with a dagger and pouring her
      blood into the central basin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613236
    - rid: 4351268372525613237
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: To reach the height of the Companions, you must join with us in the shared
      blood of the wolf.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613238
    - rid: 4351268372525613239
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you prepared to join your spirit with the beast world?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613240
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: No.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: What?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm not going to become a werewolf; I agree with Kodlak, your "gift"
      is a curse.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613241
    - rid: 4351268372525613243
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Nonsense! The great power that comes with the form allows us to be greater
      warriors-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613242
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: You've seen how Farkas could handle a whole group of men alone, just
      using his werewolf form, correct?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613244
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Who told him about that?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. Maybe you just need a taste of this power...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613245
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: W-what-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela, you can show her the <i>true</i> power of the blood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613246
    - rid: 4351268372525613247
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Before Natsuki can react, Aela charges toward her.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613248
    - rid: 4351268372525613249
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: In a single motion, Aela slams Natsuki into the basin.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613252
    - rid: 4351268372525613254
    - rid: 4351268372525613255
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Ack-! (Where's Kodlak?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613256
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The force that Aela slammed Natsuki with was strong enough to slosh around
      the blood inside, causing some of it to spill.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613257
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: What in Oblivion are the two of you doing?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613259
    - rid: 4351268372525613260
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 19994ba39eb37754eb26e44446994a72, type: 2}
    dialog: Harbinger-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Our Shield-Sister doesn't want the blood! Release her, now!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: At Kodlak's command, Aela releases Natsuki from her grasp.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613262
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: I know the title of Harbinger is not equal to that of a leader, but-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: The two of you have conspired to increase the influence of the blood,
      against my wishes and against the wishes of your fellow Companions!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Thank goodness... he's here to talk some sense into them.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613263
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait... why do I taste iron?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613264
    - rid: 4351268372525613265
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki wipes at her tongue, where the taste of iron is most pronounced.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Blood? I know she hit me pretty hard into the basin, but I don't remember
      biting the inside of my lip, or something...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613266
    - rid: 4351268372525613268
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Some blood must've spilt from the basin into my mouth-! Gross!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613267
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Hey... why did Skjor pour her blood into the basin, anyway? Was I supposed
      to drink it-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613269
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: Ysgramor himself would-! Shield-Sister?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613270
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki's eyes glaze over as...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613271
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: She transforms into a werewolf for the first time, thanks to her (unwillingly)
      ingesting a portion of Aela's blood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613272
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb5b825b0be0b62428004be39a77cc24, type: 2}
    dialog: By the Nine, look at what you fools have done-!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The, now feral, Natsuki slashes her way outside of the Underforge, injuring
      everyone on her way out.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613273
    - rid: 4351268372525613274
    - rid: 4351268372525613275
    - rid: 4351268372525613293
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613276
    - rid: 4351268372525613278
    - rid: 4351268372525613294
    - rid: 4351268372525613295
    - rid: 4351268372525613296
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uuuuhh... my head hurts like hell...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613280
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (What happened-?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613281
    - rid: 4351268372525613283
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, you're finally awake.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613284
    - rid: 4351268372525613285
    - rid: 4351268372525613286
    - rid: 4351268372525613291
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Aela?!? Where the hell are we-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268372525613287
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Slow down, fresh-blood; since your transformation was not easy, you should
      take a minute to focus.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (So those punks really turned me into a werewolf?!?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: But, you're still alive. Congratulations.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: We even have a celebration planned for you.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (With friends like these, I'd hate to see what they consider to be a
      "celebration.")
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: There's a pack of werewolf hunters camped nearby at Gallow's Rock.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: The Silver Hand. I <i>think</i> you've met them before.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: We're going to slaughter them. <i>All</i> of them...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Figures.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675460
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: Lead on; Skjor's already scouting ahead.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Okay, we're by this Gallow's Rock, but where even <i>are</i> we?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675461
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6f47b2f061a0a3249992cdd21d6995ed, type: 2}
    dialog: We're about halfway between Whiterun and Windhelm.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Natsuki pulls out her map, trying to estimate her current position based
      on what Aela said.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675462
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright, so I'm about here...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Wait, is Aela seriously suggesting we go raid a fort while we're sleep-deprived?!?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675463
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675464
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Whatever, there's probably a bed somewhere in there.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675465
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Just gotta fight for it...!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675466
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, let's go take care of those werewolf hunters.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675467
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9f0072f96d4dfc24f9477258c07882f5, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not like you gave me a choice...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675468
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Somewhat against her better judgement, Natsuki heads toward the fort
      in hopes of getting some shut-eye after the long day she's had.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675469
    - rid: 4351268399126675470
    - rid: 4351268399126675471
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As Natsuki and Aela encounter their first bits of Silver Hand resistance,
      Aela transforms into her werewolf form.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268399126675472
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
  playerChoices:
  - choiceText: 
    resultingSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4080aa8b2f5600428bf7fe403d66b32, type: 2}
